 호스트   : agent
 OS       : Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS / aarch64
 실행계정 : tokomon
==================================================================

$ sudo ufw status verbose
------------------------------------------------------------------
   Status: active
   Logging: on (low)
   Default: deny (incoming), allow (outgoing), deny (routed)
   New profiles: skip
   
   To                         Action      From
   --                         ------      ----
   20022/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # SSH
   15034/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # agent-app
   20022/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # SSH
   15034/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # agent-app
   
   [exit=0]

$ sudo ufw status numbered
------------------------------------------------------------------
   Status: active
   
        To                         Action      From
        --                         ------      ----
   [ 1] 20022/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # SSH
   [ 2] 15034/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # agent-app
   [ 3] 20022/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # SSH
   [ 4] 15034/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # agent-app
   
